/* ================= 検定コース for the スターター languages (and JLPT for the 日本語 course) =================
   Two levels per language (JLPT: three): a first level (プレミアムエコノミー) and a second (ビジネス), each in
   5 steps of 8 phrases like 英検, so the 合格圏メーター has its 40 phrases.
   Every sentence is original practice material for Babel Flight, nothing from real papers; the exam names
   belong to their owners and these courses are not official. Most meanings are shared with DELE/CILS, so
   the other display languages reuse those translations. Chinese has a 5th column (words for 並べ替え). */
